Package: mailbridge
Version: @VERSION@
Section: mail
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Ra's al Ghul <ras@alghul.com>
Depends: adduser, ca-certificates, libc6 (>= 2.31), libstdc++6, systemd
Recommends: spamd
Homepage: https://github.com/imrasalghul/mailbridge
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: secure Cloudflare-to-private-SMTP mail gateway
 Mailbridge receives encrypted inbound messages from Cloudflare Email
 Routing, screens them, and delivers them to a private SMTP server. It can
 also provide a CIDR-restricted outbound SMTP relay using provider APIs.
 .
 This package bundles a private Node.js 22 runtime and does not replace the
 Node.js packages supplied by Debian or Proxmox.
